WEBVTT

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.740
Do you think the Eternal Well grants 
insects power without a price?

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.220
They say it takes memories.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:44.380
And the greater the power it bestows, 
the more it will take...

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:48.990
Should the princess regain her entire power,

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:53.090
she will lose all of her memories!

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:58.580
H-Her memories will disappear?

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.970
<b>The Promise Is Hope 
Within Despair</b>

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:11.480
What did you mean when you said that 
she will lose all her memories?

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:19.240
You climbed out of the Eternal Well, 
from which no one may return alive?

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:22.370
You are no mere rat.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.080
What did you mean?

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.440
Exactly what I said.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:30.130
She will lose her memories, 
and forget everything.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:34.500
She won't remember a thing about you.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.120
I don't matter...

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:43.930
But you're saying that she'll forget 
the fun and happiness she had?!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:45.780
You are quite stupid.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.560
I'm giving you a very simple explanation,

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.940
but you still cannot understand?

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.300
What are you doing?

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.660
I'm going to save the servant, of course!

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:05.160
She can't forget all the fun she had...

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.160
I will not allow that to happen!

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:09.740
It's too late...

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.290
You are too late.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:24.080
He was fortunate enough to survive, 
and then he threw his life away.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.600
What a fool.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.750
Indeed, he is a fool...

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:30.100
But I, Tokugawa Munenao,

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.440
shall not allow you to laugh at him!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.230
Stop your squeaking, rat.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.080
Interesting.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.970
So there are still humans who carry 
the winds of battle with them?

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:21.460
Tsukishima, it was fun.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.410
Tsukishima!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.410
Miss!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.420
What are you doing?!

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.510
You can't stay here!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:48.550
In exchange for restoring your power, 
you'll lose all of your memories!

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:53.600
My memories will disappear?

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:08.760
<i>I'll lose my memories
 of Tsukishima?</i>

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:16.880
<i>Of all the fun we had?</i>

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:28.120
<i>I swore that I would live on, 
with the memories you gave me...</i>

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:37.460
Now, let's get out of this well!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.800
What are you saying?

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.690
If I cannot regain my power, we won't 
be able to defeat Yukimura!

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:43.950
Don't worry...

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:50.200
I can squash that insect without your power!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.910
What's wrong, Tsukishima?

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.810
It can't be... My poison?

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:03.920
This is nothing...

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.930
Now, let's go.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:11.280
You can't forget the fun 
and happiness you had,

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.650
not even for the sake of duty...

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.850
You just can't!

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.980
Leave Yukimura to me.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:27.530
Believe in me, Tsukishima Jinbei... Miss!

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.280
Let's go, Jinbei.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.380
Get out of here while you can!

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:56.770
You're mine!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.280
Not happening!

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:09.570
Too slow.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.700
What is this?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.010
I can't breathe...

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.700
It smells worse than a fart.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.440
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:23.490
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.490
Fall back for now.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:28.260
You don't need to tell me... 
I can't take this.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.010
To us, it merely smells like smoke.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.390
But I guess they don't like it.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:38.000
Could this be the Chinpou-style Insect Repellent?

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.800
Hey, she said it...

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:41.780
She said "Chinpou-style."

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:42.650
Shut up!

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:45.360
Onee-sama!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:48.650
Onee-sama!

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.730
I'm glad you're okay...

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.280
I'm so happy!

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:53.810
I knew it.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.140
That's right...

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.510
It's our clan's secret Bug-Blasting Smoke.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:01.830
<b>Chinpou-style: 
Bug-Blasting Smoke</b>

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.310
Chinpou-style Bug-Blasting Smoke!

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.830
Chinpou-style is so great—

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.290
Stop saying that!

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:06.330
But you followed the plan precisely, right?

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.280
Of course.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.800
Most of the city has evacuated.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:12.460
The rest will soon be out.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:15.950
So, you got any more of 
this bug-blaster stuff?

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:17.930
Yes... Over there.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:20.680
Time to strike back.

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.480
You're mine.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.110
Now, then...

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.100
Where did the princess go?

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.750
It just stinks so much.

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:44.210
There's more where that came from!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.560
Now!

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.710
I can do it!

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.970
How're you liking the smoke?

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:04.040
How do you like my farts?

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:09.830
They don't smell too bad, 
but they make a big blast!

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:15.610
They'll blow away your Insect Repellent!

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:16.740
There...

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:23.580
Oh, crap.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.050
I won't kill you.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.860
Wow...

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:42.950
He cut the blast wave in half.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:44.220
Go quickly.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.610
Right!

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:57.070
Being alive is amusing...

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:59.450
Is this the time for amusement?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.640
I have died once.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:05.620
I know full well how wonderful living is.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.380
<i>My lord! Princess Naa!</i>

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:16.890
<i>My lord! My lord!</i>

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:21.930
<i>I, Yukimura, failed to protect 
you from this poison...</i>

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.060
<i>Princess Naa...</i>

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.690
<i>Where is Princess Naa?</i>

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:31.000
<i>Is she all right?</i>

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.920
<i>You would save me?</i>

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:46.790
<i>H-How dare you even try, insect?</i>

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:52.070
<i>I do not require an ugly insect's assistance.</i>

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:54.630
<i>I, Yukimura, shall not die from this...</i>

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:00.950
<i>Stop...</i>

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:03.720
<i>Stay out of my heart.</i>

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:07.060
<i>I refuse to be a mere insect's servant!</i>

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:09.350
<i>Stop!</i>

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.890
<i>I serve Lord Toyotomi...</i>

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.450
It was a foolish loyalty.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:27.040
I now know how much more 
important it is to live than die.

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:33.170
You are no longer Sanada Yukimura, 
the hero of the civil wars!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.870
No, I am Yukimura.

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:37.610
In body and soul.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.030
My lord,

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:45.580
the Insect of the Eternal Land, 
used all its power reviving Princess Naa.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.640
Making me an Insect-man was all it could do.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.730
And it took a century for me 
to emerge from my cocoon.

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:56.320
This time, you will sleep forever!

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.180
Interesting.

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:14.470
Humans are so interesting...

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:16.590
Even rats!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.490
You will make a splendid Insect-man.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:32.350
Insect-man!

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:35.830
This comes from our ancestors!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:39.700
<i>Kishuu-style Castle Construction,
 Secret Technique: Avalanche!</i>

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:40.860
Here it comes!

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:01.010
Well? Did my secret technique...

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.050
Rat...

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.900
You are nothing but boring rats, all of you.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.150
Now, I tire of this.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:24.780
It's time for the princess to enter the Well.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.780
Miss, we're almost to the gate.

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:35.160
I'll carry you all the way to Edo...

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.840
Sanada Yukimura!

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:43.650
Princess, let us end this game.

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.430
Stay behind me, miss.

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:48.940
Your loyalty in protecting 
the princess, even now...

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:51.160
Rat, you have my compliments.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.600
It isn't loyalty!

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:57.580
Whether she's a princess or not, 
I shall protect her life.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.060
As a samurai, that is my duty!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.400
Then fulfill it.

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.610
Yukimura...

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.430
This is the duty of a samurai.

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:23.470
Tsukishima!

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:29.250
You appear to have quite 
an interest in that rat.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:33.930
The Princess Naa I knew was very different.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.350
How sad.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.650
You were such a kind girl, you would pity

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.860
even an ugly insect.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:47.570
But for you to take interest in such a rat...

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:51.360
Perhaps I shall kill him first.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.860
Or will you enter the Well?

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:57.900
Miss, I won't die here!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:58.580
Oh?

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:01.830
If nothing else, you have a big mouth...

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.050
Stop!

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.680
No, miss...

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:14.230
Stop it, Yukimura!

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:17.130
Please, stop this...

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.980
<i>Lotus Root Blast!</i>

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.590
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.410
This is the end.

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.600
Kotori-san!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:02.960
Reinforcements?

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:14.860
After you left, I did some thinking.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:19.870
If Sanada Yukimura had intended 
to kill the Insect Magistrate,

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:23.500
he would have attacked Edo with 
the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:27.050
Then there'd have been nothing for us to do.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:32.690
But Yukimura sent only Sarutobi Sasuke.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.470
I thought there must have been a reason.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:38.970
What are you planning, Insect-men?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.470
I couldn't tell you!

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:47.120
The Ten Crucifix Insects simply 
obey our lord, Yukimura-sama.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:51.240
His deeper thoughts are beyond us.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.940
My, my...

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.740
Then you're merely foot soldiers.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:17:00.140
I'll show you what happened to the last person

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.500
who looked down on us.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.510
Those are Oooka-san's...

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.650
Did you kill him?

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:10.370
Apparently, he was

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:13.370
disrespectful enough to challenge 
Yukimura-sama directly.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.760
I'm sure he was...

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:17.610
You could not have killed Oooka-kun.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.790
All of you, go to the Magistrate.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.270
What about you?

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:28.770
I must demonstrate to them the anger of one

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.520
whose fellow student

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:32.740
has been killed.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.750
Now, Princess...

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:48.790
I dislike the idea of forcing you.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:52.170
Do as you wish.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.340
All right.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:18:00.120
But promise me you will not kill him.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.410
Very well.

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:05.020
But how long will he live, either way?

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.520
Please don't...

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.320
He won't keep his promise...

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:12.950
Little rat.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.970
I will forget you.

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:27.970
However, please remember me.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.900
I shall never forget!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.940
It's impossible for me to forget you.

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:37.600
I cannot... I am a samurai!

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:40.340
Even in death, I shall remember you.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.350
I promise!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:45.990
Yes.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:52.110
Even in death, I shall not forget you, either.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.130
Miss...

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:26.520
Miss!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.230
The world no longer belongs to you humans.

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:51.500
It will belong to the Insect-men.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.540
You are of no importance.

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:56.090
What?!

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:56.090
You little...

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:01.800
<i>Flowering Wind-style Draw:</i>

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.280
<i>Divine Punishment.</i>

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.450
Why?

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.220
Why does she not transform
 into a Kuroageha butterfly?

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:31.260
With the power of the Eternal Well, 
you should become a Kuroageha butterfly...

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:32.920
No, you must!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.250
<i>Flowering Branches!</i>

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.860
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:41.260
<i>Full-Power Corkscrew Punch!</i>

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:48.510
<i>Compassion Slash!</i>

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:53.520
<i>Flowering Wind-style Draw:</i>

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:54.650
<i>Flying Swallow!</i>

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:58.900
Everyone...

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:00.900
He's coming.

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:06.410
I'll have to take the princess 
to Oosaka Castle by force.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:10.160
The Insect Magistrate's will protect the servant!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:16.190
You cannot win this!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.450
No...

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:01.860
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:01.860
I'll never forget it!

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:03.710
The warmth I felt in my hand...

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:04.320
Tsukishima...

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:06.860
The size of Oharu-dono's big peaches

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:07.780
or their softness!

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:10.070
That's how we're ending this?!

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:11.570
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.000
Tsukishima Jinbei Is Here.

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Tsukishima Jinbei Is Here!!!</b>
